    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d331">

                <pb facs="0454" n="1208" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v02/pg1208"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 652.119/66</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Spain</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Willard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-05T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 5, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>697. Your 797, September 21, 12 noon. At present cannot facilitate departure <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bartolo</hi>, as United States needs coal and
                    nitrates.</p>
                <p>Pending settlement of British-Spanish agreement regarding fuel and iron ore
                    cannot release oil and coal for Spain. Therefore cannot release <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Cataluña</hi>. Further, cannot release oil or gasoline
                    unless assured as to consignees.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
